@!!status:to be proved
@!!obl:ASSUME NEW VARIABLE u,
       NEW VARIABLE v,
       NEW VARIABLE z,
       J!En ==
         ?EnabledWrapper(LAMBDA r#0, r#1 :
                           r#1 = u + 1 /\ r#0 = v - 1
